  "description": "The Privateer is practical CrMo steel frame that can be built up as an \"all rounder\" road bike, a medium duty loaded touring bike, or a trusty commuter. You can even take it on gravel and fire roads with the proper tires. Its horizontal dropouts allow you the options to run a derailleur drivetrain, internal geared hub, or single speed.\n\nThis latest update includes a new 64cm size and two colorways. We also chose to use the 650b wheel size on the three smallest sizes, because those sizes often have pronounced toe overlap with wider 700c tires.\n\nExtra tall headtube makes upright builds look better\n\nPump peg on headtube\n\nTubes have an anti-rust coating inside",
